README/ARCHITECTURE 明确 Object Storage 是平台目标能力；本轮已完成 production ObjectStore composition、fail-closed config、runtime/readiness ownership、Artifact metadata repository 和 owned MinIO real gate。独立与 production evidence 均不加入 P0-09F transaction，也不声称跨 PostgreSQL/S3 exactly-once；current owner-scoped same-network G-D ordinary/race 也已 PASS，P0-09G-R/P0-09 仍保持 `partial`。
